reject-action-per-row-over-state: REJECT view:rejected[action-capture]
    view[action-capture] it is a parameter of an enclosing function, so a caller may pass it a value that depends on state; an action may use from its cell only inputs that hold no state and the consts and functions made from them, so pass the value to the action when it is called
accept-input-onInput-row-id: ACCEPT
